      "observed": "C1 is populated as 0.1uF/16V and is connected between Display_Power_Switch and GND.",
      "expected": "The specification requires C1 to be 1uF/25V in this EPD driver charge-pump/boost position.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C1\") (value \"0.1uF/16V\")"
