        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C2 default: 1 µF/25 V | C1/C5/C7/C8/C9/C10 = 1 µF/25 V | Matches default"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The EPD boost/charge-pump network has a ten-times lower capacitance than intended at the switched display power node, which can disturb voltage generation and timing for the e-paper panel and may prevent the display from operating correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files match the specification for the main power, keyboard, SD, UART, USB, and display control paths, but C1 in the EPD driver is 0.1uF/16V instead of the specified 1uF/25V, which is a clear deviation likely to affect e-paper display power generation."
}

